Package: termr
Title: Reactive Terminal UI Framework for R
Version: 1.0.3
Authors@R:
    person("Akims", "Mensikovs", email = "akimm7926@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Build interactive terminal user interfaces (TUIs) in R using
    reusable widgets, layouts, events, focus management and themes.
    Compose reactive applications, terminal dashboards and data explorers.
    A virtual screen buffer and incremental rendering update changed cells,
    while a headless driver supports deterministic application tests.
    Advanced features include experimental reactive graph APIs, lazy table
    sources, SQL editing, optional database tools, background R workers and
    static text, Markdown, HTML, SVG and JSON exports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://menshikovs.github.io/termr/, https://github.com/menshikovs/termr
